OL,3,GNEWSAPolice worker leaked info to keep
OL,4,Agang out of jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police call handler who leaked
OL,7,Finformation to a cocaine gang to try to
OL,8,Fkeep them out of jail has been jailed
OL,9,Falong with three drug dealers.
OL,11,FCameron Clifford, who worked for Durham
OL,12,FPolice, was given a false tip about his
OL,13,Fcriminal associates by suspicious
OL,14,Finvestigators which he then frantically
OL,15,Ftried to pass on to the gang, Teesside
OL,16,FCrown Court heard.
OL,18,FA judge said Clifford wanted to keep in
OL,19,Fthe "good books" of his cocaine
OL,20,Fsuppliers, who made lives "miserable".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
