OL,3,GNEWSAPolice worker leaked info to keep
OL,4,Agang out of jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FClifford, 28, was jailed for one year
OL,7,Fand 10 months after admitting
OL,8,Fmisconduct in a public office. Three
OL,9,Fmen from Consett, County Durham, who
OL,10,Fadmitted conspiracy to supply cocaine,
OL,11,Fwere each jailed for at least three and
OL,12,Fa half years.
